<section class="ftco-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5 pb-2">
      <div class="col-md-8 text-center heading-section ftco-animate">
        <div class="icon mb-3">
          <span
            class="flaticon-shiny-tooth"
            style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--color-accent);"></span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-4">What to Expect as a New Patient</h2>
        <p>
          We understand visiting a new dental office can be intimidating. Here's
          what you can expect during your first visit with us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 d-flex ftco-animate">
        <div class="card shadow-sm w-100">
          <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
            <div class="icon mb-3">
              <span
                class="flaticon-shiny-tooth"
                style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--color-accent);"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading">Upon Arrival</h3>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>
                Our friendly front desk team will welcome you with a smile and
                guide you through the check-in process:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li>
                  Please arrive 15 minutes before your scheduled appointment
                </li>
                <li>
                  Bring your insurance information and completed new patient
                  forms (or fill them out upon arrival)
                </li>
                <li>
                  Our team will verify your information and answer any initial
                  questions
                </li>
                <li>Relax in our comfortable waiting area</li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                We strive to minimize wait times and ensure a pleasant
                experience from the moment you walk through our doors.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4 d-flex ftco-animate">
        <div class="card shadow-sm w-100">
          <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
            <div class="icon mb-3">
              <span
                class="flaticon-dentist-chair"
                style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--color-accent);"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading">During Your Exam</h3>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>
                Your first dental exam with us will be thorough and informative:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li>Review of your medical and dental history</li>
                <li>
                  Full set of digital X-rays to identify any issues not visible
                  during visual examination
                </li>
                <li>
                  Comprehensive oral examination of teeth, gums, and surrounding
                  tissues
                </li>
                <li>Oral cancer screening for your peace of mind</li>
                <li>Assessment of your bite and jaw alignment</li>
                <li>
                  Professional cleaning by our gentle hygienist (unless a
                  different treatment plan is needed)
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                Our dentist will explain findings in easy-to-understand terms
                and answer all your questions.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4 d-flex ftco-animate">
        <div class="card shadow-sm w-100">
          <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
            <div class="icon mb-3">
              <span
                class="flaticon-tooth-with-braces"
                style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--color-accent);"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading">Treatment Planning</h3>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>
                After your examination, we'll create a personalized plan for
                your ongoing care:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li>Discussion of findings and recommended treatments</li>
                <li>
                  Visual aids and digital images to help you understand any
                  dental issues
                </li>
                <li>
                  Prioritization of treatments based on urgency and your
                  preferences
                </li>
                <li>
                  Transparent cost estimates and insurance coverage information
                </li>
                <li>Scheduling of follow-up appointments as needed</li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                We believe in collaborative decision-making – you'll never feel
                pressured into treatments. Our goal is to provide you with the
                information you need to make confident choices about your dental
                health.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
